Robot's copy of Bouncy Castle's Argon2 (1.1: encrypted backups)

Source: Bouncy Castle 1.81, https://github.com/bcgit/bc-java at tag r1rv81 (7cf6d995313e4bad26eb0c75e86769c4700f20eb),
core/src/main/java/. The release published on Maven Central as org.bouncycastle:bcprov-jdk18on:1.81
(bcprov-jdk18on-1.81.jar, sha256 249f396412b0c0ce67f25c8197da757b241b8be3ec4199386c00704a2457459b). The copied code
gives the same output as that jar's own classes: Argon2id, Argon2i and Argon2d with 60 random settings, the backup's
64 MiB setting, and 200 BLAKE2b digests (checked on the build machine, 2026-10-12); BackupKdfTest checks RFC 9106's
Argon2id test vector and RFC 7693's BLAKE2b one.

